# Cursor Rules for Woice AI React + Express Application

## Project Structure
- Frontend: React TypeScript application in `/frontend`
- Backend: Express.js TypeScript application in `/backend`

## Code Style
- Use TypeScript for type safety
- Follow React best practices (functional components, hooks)
- Use async/await for async operations
- Use meaningful variable and function names

## File Organization
- Components in `frontend/src/components/`
- Services/API calls in `frontend/src/services/`
- Backend routes in `backend/src/routes/`
- Backend models in `backend/src/models/`
- Backend middleware in `backend/src/middleware/`

## Best Practices
- Always validate user input (frontend and backend)
- Use environment variables for configuration
- Handle errors gracefully
- Use TypeScript interfaces for type definitions

